# MedLabel AI — Configuration Guide

This project contains two components:
1. **Frontend**: React + Vite + TypeScript web application (`/frontend`)
2. **Backend**: FastAPI Python service (`/backend`)
3. **Database**: Supabase PostgreSQL with Row Level Security (`/supabase`)

## Quick Environment Configuration

Copy this file to `.env` in the root and in `/backend/.env` & `/frontend/.env`:

```env
# ==============================================================================
# Supabase Configuration (Optional - App runs with local demo store if omitted)
# ==============================================================================
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...your-anon-key...
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...your-service-role-key...

# ==============================================================================
# Backend Configuration
# ==============================================================================
PORT=8000
HOST=127.0.0.1
ENVIRONMENT=development
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:5173

# ==============================================================================
# Frontend Configuration
# ==============================================================================
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
```

## Running the Backend
```powershell
cd backend
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
python -m uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
```
Health Check: `http://localhost:8000/api/health`
Interactive Docs: `http://localhost:8000/docs`

## Running the Frontend
```powershell
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```
Accessible at: `http://localhost:5173`
